# Video production assets. The renders and voice-overs are ~60MB — a 22MB mp4 plus a zip
# duplicating it — and git has no good story for binaries that size in a public repo.
# The script, the cue sheets and the mux tooling are text and are tracked.
docs/video/*.mp4
docs/video/*.mp3
docs/video/*.zip
docs/video/*.mov
docs/video/*.wav
